      "comment": "SNOW MONKEY (8) brings the strongest exposed form, with a Listed Supremacy Stakes second to Aurum Belle last campaign, looking a superior reference for a Maiden of this depth. Her G2 Karrakatta Plate finish was plain, but she's trialled well coming into this and a couple of gear changes can see her come out on top. LITTLEWOOD (2) made a sound debut at Kalgoorlie, travelling well and finishing second. He should derive benefit from that effort and with that form already being franked, he can go on with the job. BIRDIEBIRDIE (6) is the unknown runner among the main hopes, but he's shown enough at the trials to suggest he can run a cheeky race on debut. THREE VIRGO'S (7) draws the inside on the back of a nice trial recently and she won't be far away.",
